        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Saltador. Spoink morre se parar de quicar. A pérola em sua cabeça amplifica seus poderes psíquicos. Ele usa a cauda como uma mola e mantém o coração batendo ao saltar constantemente.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Spoink pode evoluir para Grumpig no nível 11 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Splash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Confusion, Psywave</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Growl, Odor Sleuth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Psybeam, Psych Up</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Confuse Ray</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Magic Coat</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Zen Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Power Gem, Rest</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Snore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Psyshock</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Payback</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Bounce, Psychic</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Ally Switch, Amnesia, Attract, Body Slam, Bounce, Calm Mind, Charge Beam, Chilling Water, Confide, Confuse Ray, Covet, Dazzling Gleam, Double Team, Dream Eater, Encore, Endeavor, Endure, Expanding Force, Facade, Flash Cannon, Frustration, Future Sight, Grass Knot, Heal Bell, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Icy Wind, Imprison, Iron Tail, Light Screen, Lunge, Magic Coat, Night Shade, Payback, Power Gem, Protect, Psybeam, Psych Up, Psychic, Psychic Terrain, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Recycle, Reflect, Rest, Return, Role Play, Round, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snarl, Snatch, Snore, Snowscape, Stored Power, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Taunt, Telekinesis, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder Wave, Torment, Toxic, Trailblaze, Trick, Trick Room, Uproar, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Amnesia, Endure, Extrasensory, Future Sight, Lucky Chant, Mirror Coat, Simple Beam, Skill Swap, Trick, Whirlwind, Zen Headbutt</p>",
